@CGG.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000
@CGG.Api_HostAddress_Http = http://localhost:5296

### Health Check
GET {{CGG.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Register User
POST {{CGG.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "displayName": "Test User",
  "role": 0
}

###

### Register Another User
POST {{CGG.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "Student123!",
  "displayName": "Student User",
  "role": 0
}

###

### Login
POST {{CGG.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###

### Login (save token)
# @name login
POST {{CGG.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###

### Use saved token for authenticated request
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

GET {{CGG.Api_HostAddress}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###
